#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2377
msgid "Delete expired sessions"
msgstr "Süresi dolan oturumları sil"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2379
msgid "Back up first. Shoppers with an expired cart lose it, which has already happened by definition."
msgstr "Önce yedekleyin. Süresi dolmuş sepeti olan alışverişçiler sepetlerini yitirir; tanımı gereği bu zaten olmuştur."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2390
msgid "Action Scheduler backlog"
msgstr "Action Scheduler birikimi"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2393
msgid "Pending and failed background jobs. A steady backlog is normal on a busy store; a very large one suggests the queue is not draining."
